Hub Preview Studio is an independent community tool. It is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Even Realities and does not replace the official simulator.

Even Realities, Even Hub and G2 are names of their respective owner. References
to these products describe compatibility only.

No Even Hub SDK implementation, commercial font files, or vendor artwork is
bundled. The preview bridge implements a limited compatible API surface;
projects obtain the official SDK separately under its own terms. Font names
in CSS use locally available fonts with system fallbacks.
